// LIBERTASIAN — EAS App Store metadata-as-code (Apple only).
//
// REQUIRES, before running `eas metadata push`:
//   1. App registered in App Store Connect with bundle id `com.libertasian.app`
//      (see SUBMISSION_CHECKLIST.md → "Apple — register the app").
//   2. Credentials in place: `appleId`, `appleTeamId`, and `ascAppId` filled in
//      `eas.json` → `submit.production.ios` (currently `YOUR_*` placeholders).
//   3. Demo reviewer account created (MFA disabled) and the `apple.review` block
//      added below by hand — kept out of version control to avoid leaking the
//      demo credentials. See SUBMISSION_CHECKLIST.md → "Apple — review test account".
//
// Play Store has no EAS metadata-as-code equivalent — see `store/PLAY_LISTING.md`
// for the paste-ready Play Console copy.
//
// JSONC: leading `//` line comments are stripped by EAS' JSON5-tolerant parser
// (same convention used in `eas.json`). The CI JSON-validity check strips
// these comments before `JSON.parse` (see PR description for the one-liner).
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// STATE OF THE LIVE LISTING - read before touching `description` or pushing.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// 1. The `description` below is CORRECT and must not be edited to "fix" the
//    live copy. The LIVE App Store description still ends its Past Bar Exams
//    bullet with "...AI-generated ALAC answers for paid users" - verified
//    2026-08-29 against TWO sources: the iTunes lookup API
//    (itunes.apple.com/lookup?id=6788971669&country=ph), which returned that
//    line verbatim, and the rendered
//    apps.apple.com/ph/app/libertasian/id6788971669 page, which answered
//    HTTP 200 with three occurrences of the bullet. (Repeated fetches of the
//    rendered page rate-limit to HTTP 429; that is throttling, not an
//    unavailable source.) The divergence is expected: this file was corrected
//    in #421 and the store has not taken it yet.
//
// 2. Apple FREEZES Description once a version is Ready for Distribution, so
//    the live text cannot change until a 1.0.1 submission carries it. Naming
//    a purchasable class of user is what App Review flagged under Guideline
//    2.1(b), so shipping 1.0.1 is what actually retires that line - not an
//    edit here.
//
// 3. `eas metadata:push` has NEVER been run against this listing. Before it
//    ever is:
//      - no `apple.review` block is committed (the demo reviewer credentials
//        are deliberately kept out of version control). A push sends this
//        file as the whole listing, so it may CLEAR the demo-account fields
//        already entered in App Store Connect. Add the block by hand for the
//        push, or re-enter the fields afterwards.
//      - the `advisory` age-rating block below is commented out because
//        eas-cli rejects the legacy schema it uses. The age rating is
//        answered by hand in the ASC questionnaire; a push does not carry it.
{
  "configVersion": 0,
  "apple": {
    "version": "1.0",
    "copyright": "2026 LIBERTASIAN Inc.",
    "categories": ["REFERENCE", "EDUCATION"],
    "info": {
      "en-US": {
        "title": "LIBERTASIAN",
        "subtitle": "Philippine legal research",
        "description": "LIBERTASIAN is a Philippine legal research library for law students, bar reviewees, and practitioners.\n\n• Past Bar Exams — 97 sittings, 1,500+ questions from 1953–2024 with AI-generated ALAC answers.\n• Case Digests — Philippine Supreme Court cases with facts, issues, ruling, doctrine, and provenance, generated from authoritative sources only.\n• Codal Reader — Republic Acts, the 1987 Constitution, and the Rules of Court, organized by bar subject with cross-references.\n• AI Study Assistant — chat and Q&A grounded in what you are reading. Sourced answers only; the model abstains rather than fabricate.\n• Camera Scan-to-Digest — point your camera at a pleading or case printout and get a structured digest with citations back to the source.\n• Offline codal cache and cross-device sync between mobile and web.\n\nPrivate by default. Your uploads, scans, and notes stay scoped to your organization. Nothing you upload is ever used to train our models or shared without your explicit consent.\n\nLIBERTASIAN provides AI-powered legal research tools for informational purposes only. AI outputs are not legal advice and do not create an attorney-client relationship. Always consult a qualified Philippine lawyer for legal matters.",
        "keywords": [
          "Philippine law",
          "bar exam",
          "case digests",
          "codals",
          "Supreme Court",
          "jurisprudence",
          "RA",
          "RPC",
          "law school"
        ],
        "releaseNotes": "\u2022 The codal reader now opens straight from Library instead of sitting inside the study section.\n\u2022 Library lists what your account can open, so nothing is shown that it cannot.\n\u2022 The usage screen reports only the allowances that apply to you.\n\u2022 Navigation fixes for deep links, notification taps, and restored sessions.",
        "promoText": "Plain-language Philippine case digests, codals, and 1,500+ bar exam questions — built for Filipino law students and lawyers.",
        "marketingUrl": "https://libertasian.com",
        "supportUrl": "https://libertasian.com/contact",
        "privacyPolicyUrl": "https://libertasian.com/privacy"
      }
    },
    // LEGACY age-rating format — rejected by eas-cli metadata:push, which now
    // requires `kidsAgeBand`, `ageRatingOverride` and `koreaAgeRatingOverride`.
    // Deliberately NOT rewritten to guess at the new schema; the age rating is
    // answered by hand in the App Store Connect questionnaire instead
    // (App Information → Age Ratings → Set Up Age Ratings).
    // "advisory": {
    //   "alcoholTobaccoOrDrugUseOrReferences": "INFREQUENT_OR_MILD",
    //   "contests": "NONE",
    //   "gamblingSimulated": "NONE",
    //   "horrorOrFearThemes": "NONE",
    //   "matureOrSuggestiveThemes": "INFREQUENT_OR_MILD",
    //   "medicalOrTreatmentInformation": "NONE",
    //   "profanityOrCrudeHumor": "NONE",
    //   "sexualContentGraphicAndNudity": "NONE",
    //   "sexualContentOrNudity": "INFREQUENT_OR_MILD",
    //   "violenceCartoonOrFantasy": "NONE",
